"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">44</div><h1>양보와 조건의 고급 구문</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Konzessive und konditionale Strukturen</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 44의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>C1 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 · 보강 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">실제 일의 obwohl과 가정의 auch wenn · selbst wenn을 구별해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">so … auch · was auch immer · egal로 '아무리 ~해도 · 무엇을 ~하든'을 말해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">sollte로 시작하는 조건문과 wenn 없는 조건문을 써요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">es sei denn · außer wenn · sonst · trotzdem의 뜻과 어순을 지켜요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">바꿔 쓰기는 문장 전체를 써요. 쉼표와 마침표는 채점하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">틀린 곳 찾기는 문장에서 틀린 단어 하나를 눌러요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">푼 답은 이 기기에 저장돼요. 새로고침하거나 앱을 업데이트해도 남아 있어요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"2650f90f35\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> es morgen schneit, fahren wir in die Berge.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) Auch wenn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) Trotzdem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) Obwohl</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) Dennoch</button></div><div class=\"qe\">내일 눈이 올지는 아직 몰라요. 일어날지 모르는 일은 auch wenn이에요. obwohl은 실제로 일어난 일에 써요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"104e4b44c4\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> er seit Wochen trainiert, hat er das Rennen verloren.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) Trotzdem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) Sonst</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) Dennoch</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) Obwohl</button></div><div class=\"qe\">동사 trainiert가 끝에 있으니 종속접속사가 필요해요. 실제로 한 일이라서 obwohl이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"3620e16760\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Selbst wenn ich Zeit <span class=\"qblank\"></span>, würde ich nicht mitkommen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) hatte</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">b) habe</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) haben</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) hätte</button></div><div class=\"qe\">selbst wenn은 '설령 ~한다 해도'예요. 실제와 다른 가정이라서 접속법 II를 써요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"a6f57a4e6d\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> es Fragen geben, wenden Sie sich bitte an die Rezeption.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) Wenn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) Sollte</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) Soll</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) Sollten</button></div><div class=\"qe\">sollte로 시작하는 조건문은 '혹시 ~한다면'이에요. 주어가 es라서 sollte, 본동사는 원형 geben이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"02fcd6292f\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Zieh eine Jacke an, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> erkältest du dich.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) sonst</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) außer wenn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) falls</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) obwohl</button></div><div class=\"qe\">sonst는 '그렇지 않으면'이에요. 접속부사라서 바로 뒤에 동사 erkältest가 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"7c2a6867cb\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Wir grillen am Samstag, es sei <span class=\"qblank\"></span>, es regnet.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) dass</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) denn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) wenn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) dann</button></div><div class=\"qe\">es sei denn은 '~하지 않는 한'이에요. 뒤에는 주문장 어순(es regnet)이 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"af2f49bd1a\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Auch&quot;,&quot;Selbst&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(~하더라도)</span> wenn die Karten teuer sind, will ich das Konzert sehen.</div><div class=\"qko\">표가 비싸더라도 그 공연은 보고 싶어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Auch</b> wenn die Karten teuer sind, will ich das Konzert sehen.</div>auch wenn · selbst wenn = ~하더라도. 동사는 종속절 끝에 가요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"6a87664374\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;auch&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> So müde ich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> bin, ich lese dir noch eine Geschichte vor.</div><div class=\"qko\">아무리 피곤해도 이야기 하나는 더 읽어 줄게.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · So müde ich <b>auch</b> bin, ich lese dir noch eine Geschichte vor.</div>so + 형용사 … auch = 아무리 ~해도.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"0df9c514d5\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;immer&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Was auch <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> geschieht, wir halten zusammen.</div><div class=\"qko\">무슨 일이 일어나든 우리는 함께해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Was auch <b>immer</b> geschieht, wir halten zusammen.</div>was auch immer = 무엇이 ~하든. 의문사 + auch immer예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"05552b292a\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Egal&quot;,&quot;Gleich&quot;,&quot;Gleichgültig&quot;,&quot;Einerlei&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:14ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(상관없이)</span>, was er sagt, ich glaube ihm nicht mehr.</div><div class=\"qko\">그가 무슨 말을 하든 나는 이제 그를 믿지 않아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Egal</b>, was er sagt, ich glaube ihm nicht mehr.</div>egal, was … = 무엇을 ~하든 상관없이. ganz gleich, was …라고도 해요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"e0cb1b842d\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;haben&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> Sollte der Zug Verspätung <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(원형)</span>, nehmen wir ein Taxi.</div><div class=\"qko\">혹시 기차가 늦으면 택시를 타요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Sollte der Zug Verspätung <b>haben</b>, nehmen wir ein Taxi.</div>sollte는 화법조동사라서 본동사는 원형으로 끝에 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"7dceb29586\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;oder&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Ob es dir gefällt <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> nicht, wir müssen sparen.</div><div class=\"qko\">네 마음에 들든 안 들든 우리는 아껴야 해.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ob es dir gefällt <b>oder</b> nicht, wir müssen sparen.</div>ob … oder nicht = ~하든 말든.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"a12ac98dff\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;auch&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> Das Zimmer war sauber, wenn <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> etwas klein.</div><div class=\"qko\">방은 조금 작긴 했지만 깨끗했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das Zimmer war sauber, wenn <b>auch</b> etwas klein.</div>wenn auch + 형용사 = ~이긴 하지만. 문장이 아니라 형용사만 덧붙여요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"4739b41fc0\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Trotzdem&quot;,&quot;Dennoch&quot;,&quot;Gleichwohl&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> Die Wanderung war anstrengend. <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:12ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(접속부사)</span> hat sie allen Spaß gemacht.</div><div class=\"qko\">산행은 힘들었어요. 그런데도 모두 즐거워했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Wanderung war anstrengend. <b>Trotzdem</b> hat sie allen Spaß gemacht.</div>trotzdem · dennoch는 접속부사예요. 바로 뒤에 동사 hat이 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"ff633b3fac\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Auch wenn es spät wird rufe ich dich an&quot;,&quot;Ich rufe dich an auch wenn es spät wird&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">늦어지더라도 너한테 전화할게.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">es</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Auch</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">an</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">spät</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">wird</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">rufe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">dich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">wenn</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Auch wenn es spät wird, rufe ich dich an.</b></div>auch wenn 문장은 종속절이에요. 앞에 오면 주문장은 동사 rufe부터 시작해요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"d12d14866e\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Stell dir einen Wecker sonst verschläfst du wieder&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">알람 맞춰, 안 그러면 또 늦잠 자.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">einen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Wecker</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">verschläfst</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">du</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">dir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Stell</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">sonst</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">wieder</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Stell dir einen Wecker, sonst verschläfst du wieder.</b></div>sonst 바로 뒤에 동사 verschläfst가 오고 주어 du는 그 뒤예요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"a5d0c46a18\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> teuer die Reise auch ist, wir buchen sie.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) Ob</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">b) Als</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) Wenn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) So</button></div><div class=\"qe\">so + 형용사 … auch = 아무리 ~해도. 뒤의 주문장은 보통 주어(wir)부터 시작해요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"276e2793f2\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> 'Wir fahren morgen los, wenn das Auto nicht kaputtgeht.'와 뜻이 같은 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) Wir fahren morgen los, sonst geht das Auto kaputt.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) Wir fahren morgen los, es sei denn, das Auto geht kaputt.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) Wir fahren morgen los, es sei denn, das Auto geht nicht kaputt.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) Wir fahren morgen los, obwohl das Auto kaputtgeht.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">es sei denn = wenn … nicht. 이미 부정의 뜻이 들어 있어서 nicht를 또 넣지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"d737f17357\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Kommt der Bus nicht bald, <span class=\"qblank\"></span>.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) wir zu Fuß gehen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) gehen wir zu Fuß</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) zu Fuß wir gehen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) wir gehen zu Fuß</button></div><div class=\"qe\">동사로 시작하는 조건문(= Wenn der Bus nicht bald kommt)이에요. 뒤의 주문장은 동사부터 시작해요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"0949751f40\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Sollten&quot;],[&quot;brauchen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> Wenn Sie Hilfe brauchen, melden Sie sich bitte.<br>→ <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(sollen · 접속법 II)</span> Sie Hilfe <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(원형)</span>, melden Sie sich bitte.</div><div class=\"qko\">혹시 도움이 필요하시면 연락 주세요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wenn Sie Hilfe brauchen, melden Sie sich bitte.<br>→ <b>Sollten</b> Sie Hilfe <b>brauchen</b>, melden Sie sich bitte.</div>wenn을 빼고 sollte를 맨 앞에 세워요. 주어가 Sie라서 Sollten, 본동사는 원형이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"3aec26decb\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;lange&quot;,&quot;lang&quot;],[&quot;auch&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Ich habe lange gesucht, aber ich habe den Schlüssel nicht gefunden.<br>→ So <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(부사)</span> ich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> gesucht habe, ich habe den Schlüssel nicht gefunden.</div><div class=\"qko\">아무리 오래 찾아도 열쇠가 나오지 않았어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich habe lange gesucht, aber ich habe den Schlüssel nicht gefunden.<br>→ So <b>lange</b> ich <b>auch</b> gesucht habe, ich habe den Schlüssel nicht gefunden.</div>so lange … auch = 아무리 오래 ~해도. so 뒤에 부사가 바로 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"a77e43c681\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Bedingung&quot;,&quot;Voraussetzung&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Ich leihe dir mein Fahrrad unter der <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:15ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(조건)</span>, dass du es morgen zurückbringst.</div><div class=\"qko\">내일 돌려준다는 조건으로 자전거를 빌려줄게.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich leihe dir mein Fahrrad unter der <b>Bedingung</b>, dass du es morgen zurückbringst.</div>unter der Bedingung, dass … = ~라는 조건으로.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"723b27559b\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;wenn&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> Wir essen jeden Abend zusammen, außer <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> einer von uns Spätdienst hat.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리 가운데 누가 늦게까지 일할 때만 빼고 저녁은 날마다 같이 먹어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir essen jeden Abend zusammen, außer <b>wenn</b> einer von uns Spätdienst hat.</div>außer wenn = ~할 때만 빼고. 동사는 끝에 가요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"d3730280fc\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wohin sie auch geht sie findet schnell Freunde&quot;,&quot;Wohin sie auch geht findet sie schnell Freunde&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀는 어디를 가든 금방 친구를 사귀어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">findet</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">sie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Freunde</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Wohin</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">sie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">geht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">schnell</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">auch</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wohin sie auch geht, sie findet schnell Freunde.</b></div>wohin … auch = 어디로 ~하든. 뒤의 주문장은 보통 주어부터 시작해요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"81c4ca4cf8\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) Angenommen, du gewinnst im Lotto: Was machst du dann?</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) Solange du nicht aufräumst, gibt es kein Eis.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) Was er auch versucht, es gelingt ihm nicht.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) Sollte es morgen regnet, fällt das Fest aus.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">sollte 뒤의 본동사는 원형이에요 → Sollte es morgen regnen, fällt das Fest aus.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"9896af4a4a\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> 실제와 다른 일을 가정해서 말하는 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) Selbst wenn er sich entschuldigen würde, könnte ich ihm nicht mehr vertrauen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">b) Obwohl er sich entschuldigt hat, kann ich ihm nicht mehr vertrauen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) Trotz seiner Entschuldigung kann ich ihm nicht mehr vertrauen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) Er hat sich entschuldigt, trotzdem kann ich ihm nicht mehr vertrauen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">selbst wenn + 접속법 II는 '설령 ~한다 해도'예요. 나머지 셋은 실제로 사과한 일을 말해요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"b1a6025cfc\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;So&quot;,&quot;Wie&quot;],[&quot;auch&quot;],[&quot;Selbst&quot;,&quot;Auch&quot;],[&quot;denn&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(아무리)</span> wichtig die Digitalisierung <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(~해도)</span> ist, sie löst nicht alle Probleme. <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(설령)</span> wenn jede Schule neue Computer bekäme, bräuchte man immer noch gute Lehrkräfte. Der Unterricht wird nicht besser, es sei <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(~하지 않는 한)</span>, die Lehrkräfte werden geschult.</div><div class=\"qko\">디지털화가 아무리 중요해도 모든 문제를 풀어 주지는 않아요. 설령 학교마다 새 컴퓨터를 받는다 해도 좋은 교사는 여전히 필요해요. 교사를 교육하지 않는 한 수업은 나아지지 않아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>So</b> wichtig die Digitalisierung <b>auch</b> ist, sie löst nicht alle Probleme. <b>Selbst</b> wenn jede Schule neue Computer bekäme, bräuchte man immer noch gute Lehrkräfte. Der Unterricht wird nicht besser, es sei <b>denn</b>, die Lehrkräfte werden geschult.</div>so … auch = 아무리 ~해도 · selbst wenn + 접속법 II = 설령 ~해도 · es sei denn = ~하지 않는 한.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"aa5ae7918e\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;sonst&quot;,&quot;andernfalls&quot;,&quot;ansonsten&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> Wenn wir heute nicht fertig werden, verlieren wir den Auftrag.<br>→ Wir müssen heute fertig werden, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:13ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(그렇지 않으면)</span> verlieren wir den Auftrag.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 오늘 끝내야 해요. 그렇지 않으면 그 일감을 잃어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wenn wir heute nicht fertig werden, verlieren wir den Auftrag.<br>→ Wir müssen heute fertig werden, <b>sonst</b> verlieren wir den Auftrag.</div>wenn … nicht를 sonst · andernfalls로 바꿨어요. 접속부사라서 뒤에 동사 verlieren이 바로 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"72a9a56e17\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Trotzdem&quot;,&quot;Dennoch&quot;,&quot;Gleichwohl&quot;],[&quot;reagierte&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> Obwohl die Warnungen deutlich waren, reagierte die Firma nicht.<br>→ Die Warnungen waren deutlich. <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:12ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(접속부사)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(동사)</span> die Firma nicht.</div><div class=\"qko\">경고가 분명했어요. 그런데도 회사는 움직이지 않았어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Obwohl die Warnungen deutlich waren, reagierte die Firma nicht.<br>→ Die Warnungen waren deutlich. <b>Trotzdem</b> <b>reagierte</b> die Firma nicht.</div>obwohl 문장을 주문장 두 개로 나눴어요. trotzdem · dennoch 뒤에는 동사가 바로 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"6f6ebcb2bd\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;So sehr ich mich auch anstrenge ich verstehe diese Regel nicht&quot;,&quot;So sehr ich mich auch anstrenge verstehe ich diese Regel nicht&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">아무리 애써도 이 규칙은 이해가 안 돼요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">sehr</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">anstrenge</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">diese</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">So</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Regel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">mich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">verstehe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"10\">auch</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>So sehr ich mich auch anstrenge, ich verstehe diese Regel nicht.</b></div>so sehr … auch = 아무리 ~해도. 동사 anstrenge는 끝에 가고, 뒤의 주문장은 보통 주어부터 시작해요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge plus-badge\">보강</span><span class=\"sub-title\">보강 문제 · 문장을 바꿔 쓰고, 틀린 단어를 찾아요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"edac1466db\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Sollten Sie Fragen haben, schreiben Sie mir eine E-Mail.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">31.</strong> sollte로 시작하는 조건문으로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Falls Sie Fragen haben, schreiben Sie mir eine E-Mail.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 31\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Sollten Sie Fragen haben, schreiben Sie mir eine E-Mail.</b></div>falls를 빼고 Sollten을 맨 앞에 세워요. 본동사 haben은 원형으로 끝에 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"eedd8030a4\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Sie hatte Fieber. Trotzdem ging sie zur Arbeit.&quot;,&quot;Sie hatte Fieber. Sie ging trotzdem zur Arbeit.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">32.</strong> obwohl 문장을 trotzdem을 쓴 문장 두 개로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Obwohl sie Fieber hatte, ging sie zur Arbeit.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 32\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Sie hatte Fieber. Trotzdem ging sie zur Arbeit.</b></div>obwohl 문장이 주문장이 되고, 둘째 문장을 trotzdem으로 시작해요. trotzdem 뒤에는 동사 ging이 바로 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"fa938ed232\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich gehe joggen, es sei denn, es regnet.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">33.</strong> es sei denn을 써서 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Ich gehe joggen, wenn es nicht regnet.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 33\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich gehe joggen, es sei denn, es regnet.</b></div>wenn … nicht = es sei denn. nicht가 빠지고 뒤는 주문장 어순이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"9ce6e41453\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"3\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">34.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">혹시 기차가 안 다니면 버스를 타요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Sollte</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">Zug</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">ausfällt,</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">nehmen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"6\">den</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"7\">Bus.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Sollte der Zug ausfallen, nehmen wir den Bus.</b></div>sollte 뒤의 본동사는 원형이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"f162853623\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"5\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">35.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">설령 돈이 더 있다고 해도 그녀는 이사하지 않을 거예요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Selbst</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">wenn</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">sie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">mehr</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">Geld</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">hat,</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"6\">würde</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"7\">sie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"8\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"9\">umziehen.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Selbst wenn sie mehr Geld hätte, würde sie nicht umziehen.</b></div>실제와 다른 가정이라서 접속법 II hätte를 써요. 주문장의 würde와 짝이 맞아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"a862c87a29\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"4\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">36.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">길이 아무리 멀어도 우리는 걸어가요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">So</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">weit</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">Weg</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">immer</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">ist,</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"6\">wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"7\">gehen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"8\">zu</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"9\">Fuß.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>So weit der Weg auch ist, wir gehen zu Fuß.</b></div>so + 형용사 뒤에는 auch가 와요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"36\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 36</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모